  birth via `gestationPeriodDays`).

  No ability: the donor's own `specialTrainables` entry (`Comfort`,
  Odyssey-gated) is a VANILLA TrainableDef, not donor content — left bare,
  no port needed.

  No `canCrossBreedWith` (donor's own block doesn't set it). Grepped every
  already-ported `RSW_*.xml` in SWBestiary for stray `<li>Lothcat</li>` —
  none found.

  Sounds: the donor's own `lifeStageAges` block uses vanilla Core
  `Pawn_Cat_*` sounds, NOT a custom Lothcat set — confirmed by reading the
  donor's own `<race>` block directly — left bare, no RSW_ port needed.

  🔴 **Checked, unrelated, untouched**: none of this item's 3 named
  Mlie-touching patch files (`BehemothArtUpres_StarWarsAnimalCollection.xml`,
  `AnimalDessicatedTexPaths_Fix.xml`, `AnimalBiomeDuplicates_Fix.xml`)
  reference Lothcat by name.

  Art: no `LothcatArtOverride` mod exists (checked `find src/RimStarWars
